This data set includes pre-screened routes for the following vehicle size and weight envelopes:
Overall Height (OAH) up to 4.88 m;
Overall Width (OAW) up to 5.00 m;
Gross Vehicle Weight (GVW) up to 80,000 kg;
Gross Vehicle Weight (GVW) up to 85,000 kg;
Gross Vehicle Weight (GVW) up to 125,000 kg.

The data source is the BC Commercial Transport Procedures Manual, which can be accessed here: https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/transportation/vehicle-safety-enforcement/information-education/commercial-transport-procedures

